{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>When your brother, a Hebrew man or a Hebrew woman, is sold to you.</b> The law of the Hebrew slave has already been mentioned, but it returns and repeats it here on account of the law of the Hebrew female servant, to innovate and say that her law is like the law of the Hebrew slave, to go free in the sixth year, and further on account of the commandment of the gift (הענקה), which it innovates concerning both of them here."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:48:24.778666882Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}